@baseUrl = http://localhost:7070/api/v1

### Books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

### Members
GET {{baseUrl}}/members

### Loans
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans

### Create book
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Refactoring", "author": "Martin Fowler"}

### Borrow a book (replace bookId with an available book)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{"bookId": "2", "memberId": "1", "dueDate": "2026-12-10", "returned": false}

### Return book (replace loanId with the created loan id)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/loans/loanId
Content-Type: application/json

{"returned": true}

### Login (response token can be used in the next request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "1", "password": "1234"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Current member, requires a JWT from login
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
